      "claim": "L6 hepatic-clearance records show verapamil is extensively metabolized (human hepatocyte CLint 117–179 mL/min/kg; rat IPRL unbound CLint 1335 mL/min/kg), but this is consistent with its measured F of 22–52% and does not provide affirmative sub-20% evidence for the query.",
