    }
  ],
  "evidence_gaps": [
    "No direct experimental oral bioavailability measurement exists for the query molecule itself.",
    "No matched IV comparator or absolute F study is available for the query.",
    "Query-specific hepatic clearance and metabolic stability are unknown; L6 records are for verapamil and imipramine, not the query.",
    "The lactam moiety and rigid carbocycle of the query may alter first-pass metabolism relative to verapamil, but no experimental data address this.",
    "No formulation, dose, or fed/fasted data are available for the query.",
    "Transfer relies on structural analogy to verapamil and valbenazine; imipramine hepatic-clearance records are less applicable."
